      <strong>THE SHORT ANSWER</strong>
      <p>Google Ads for Christmas lights help professional holiday lighting companies reach homeowners and commercial buyers actively searching for installation services. Unlike Facebook and Instagram advertising, search ads capture existing demand. The objective is to connect relevant local searches to a quote process that qualifies the project and gives the business a clear next step.</p>
