<section class="lf-guide-faq">
      <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <details><summary>Do Google Ads work for Christmas light installers?</summary><p>They can attract relevant inquiries where search demand exists, provided the business targets the right locations and connects ads to a reliable qualification and follow-up process.</p></details><details><summary>What are good keywords for Christmas lighting Google Ads?</summary><p>Start with professional installation terms and relevant geographic variations. Validate them through Keyword Planner and search-term reports.</p></details><details><summary>When should Christmas lighting companies start advertising?</summary><p>Plan ahead of peak demand, and adjust to local seasonality, commercial buying cycles and available installation capacity.</p></details><details><summary>How should installers measure Google Ads performance?</summary><p>Track qualified leads, estimates and bookings separately from raw clicks and form submissions, and connect CRM outcomes to the originating campaigns when possible.</p></details>
